OL,3,GNEWSALate night parking charges raised
OL,4,Amore than #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to scrap free late night
OL,7,Fparking in Liverpool city centre has
OL,8,Fbrought in an estimated #1.1m in
OL,9,Fadditional revenue, a Freedom of
OL,10,FInformation request revealed.
OL,12,FIn July last year, Liverpool City
OL,13,FCouncil confirmed parking charges would
OL,14,Fbe extended in the city centre until
OL,15,F23:00 BST.
OL,17,FThe Liverpool Business Leaders group,
OL,18,Fwhich submitted the request, has called
OL,19,Fon the council to provide evidence to
OL,20,Fshow the scheme has not damaged the
OL,21,Fcity's evening economy.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
