OL,3,GNEWSALate night parking charges raised
OL,4,Amore than #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool City Council spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid the income was reinvested into the
OL,8,Fcity's transport and highways network
OL,9,Fand used to strengthen enforcement
OL,10,Factivity to help tackle inconsiderate
OL,11,Fand dangerous parking.
